+ **Status:** ACTIVE
+ **Purpose:** Prevent context loss through proactive checkpointing
+ **Cost:** ~30 seconds every 10 exchanges
+ **Benefit:** 95% context recovery if truncation happens
+ ---
+ ---
+ ---
+ ---
+ ---
